  "solution": {
    "text": "Nitrous acid behaves as reducing as well as an oxidising agent. It reduces potassium permanganate, potassium dichromate, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and other strong oxidising agents. It oxidises strong reducing agents such as hydroiodic acid, sulphurous acid etc.<br /><br />It oxidises <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> into <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> in acidic medium;<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><br />It reduces acidified <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> .<br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo> </mo><mo>→</mo></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>"
